{"id":"00a1e20ba65f1f5a","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-typed-truth.md","title":"类型真理","display":"df-typed-truth — 类型真理","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-typed-truth","aliases":["91-df-typed-truth"],"display":"df-typed-truth — 类型真理","depends_on":["[[91-df-typed-language]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-typed-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-typed-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-typed-truth — 类型真理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7a7ac1c668908eae\" href=\"?note=7a7ac1c668908eae\" title=\"91-df-typed-language\">91-df-typed-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-typed-truth-—-类型真理-$\\mathrm{Typed\\text{-}Truth}$\">df-typed-truth — 类型真理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Typed\\text{-}Truth}\">\\(\\mathrm{Typed\\text{-}Truth}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}\\)</span> (类型化语言, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7a7ac1c668908eae\" href=\"?note=7a7ac1c668908eae\" title=\"91-df-typed-language\">91-df-typed-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner:\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner:\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>\n(各层相容的 Gödel 编码)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline m\">\\(\\overline m\\)</span> (自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 的对象语言数字, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}typed\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Typed\\text{-}Truth}\n\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\n\\left\\{\nT^n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}typed\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Typed\\text{-}Truth}\n\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\n\\left\\{\nT^n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Typed\\text{-}Truth}\">\\(\\mathrm{Typed\\text{-}Truth}\\)</span> : 类型真理（分层真理理论）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}}\\)</span> : 第n层语言句子集</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：类型真理是一个元层公理实例集。第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 组双条件式只让\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T^n\">\\(\\mathcal L_T^n\\)</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span> 首次出现在\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T^{n+1}\">\\(\\mathcal L_T^{n+1}\\)</span>。任意数字项都可在句法上放入一元谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span>；\n真正阻断同层说谎者推导的是这里对双条件式实例范围的限制，而不是把\n同层编码宣称为不合式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-typed-truth-—-类型真理-$\\mathrm{Typed\\text{-}Truth}$","text":"df-typed-truth — 类型真理 $\\mathrm{Typed\\text{-}Truth}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-typed-language","status":"resolved","id":"7a7ac1c668908eae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-typed-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-typed-language","status":"resolved","id":"7a7ac1c668908eae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}$ (类型化语言, see [[91-df-typed-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\overline m$ (自然数 $m$ 的对象语言数字, see [[91-df-numeral]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Typed\\text{-}Truth}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner:\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline m","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}typed\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Typed\\text{-}Truth}\n\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\n\\left\\{\nT^n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Typed\\text{-}Truth}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T^n","disp